= Project Objectives <section:project-objectives>

This project aims to establish the fundations for an automated testbench for the smart collar. It should explore the state of the art in automated testing for embedded systems with hardware in the loop. It should also evaluate the most suitable testing framework, and implement a first version of the testbench on a development kit.

The architecture should be modular and scalable; it should be easy to add tests for new features and interfaces. It should be cost effective to be serialisable in a test farm. 

